        <mxCell id="MVOuu9K8MGcWCc0OaKOU-50" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#c8a415;" value="The deep link zoldify://payment/return only navigates the UI. The single source&lt;br&gt;of truth for &quot;this was paid&quot; is the PayOS webhook hitting the backend — a user&lt;br&gt;can close the browser before being redirected, and a URL can be typed by hand.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The eight seller screens are roughly half the total app work. They are the&lt;br&gt;first thing to cut if the four-person team runs short: sellers already have&lt;br&gt;the full flow on the web, buyers do not.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Screens inside a group box are drawn without arrows between them on purpose —&lt;br&gt;a group is a navigation stack, and every screen in it is reachable from every&lt;br&gt;other. Arrows are only drawn where one stack hands over to another." vertex="1">
